<title>NEW ZEALAND: National Bank's Orr named head of RBNZ economics.</title>
<headline>National Bank's Orr named head of RBNZ economics.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said it had appointed National Bank of New Zealand chief economist Adrian Orr as its Chief Manager Economics.</p>
<p>He has previously worked as chief analyst for the budget management branch of the New Zealand Treasury and as an economist with the OECD in Paris.</p>
<p>Orr replaces David Mayes whose contract expires in June.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
